@startuml
!theme plain
title Query Pipeline: COUNT + JOIN + Predicate

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor LightGreen
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor LightYellow
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor LightBlue
  BorderColor Black
}

actor "Spark / Client" as client

node "ArrowFlight Node" as node {
  database "Hazelcast" as hz
  component "1. SQL Parser\n(jOOQ)" as parser
  component "2. File Locator\n(ParquetAdapter)" as locator
  component "3. QueryPlanner" as planner
  component "4. ExecutionService" as exec
  database "5. DuckDB\n(embedded)" as duck
  database "HDFS\n(Parquet)" as hdfs
}

node "ArrowFlight\nNode 2" as node2
node "ArrowFlight\nNode 3" as node3

client --> node : SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM orders o\nJOIN lineitem l\nON o.o_orderkey = l.l_orderkey\nWHERE o.o_totalprice > 100000

node --> parser : parse SQL

note right of parser
  Extracts:
  - Tables: orders, lineitem
  - Predicate: o_totalprice > 100000
  - JOIN: o_orderkey = l_orderkey
  - Agg: COUNT(*)
end note

parser --> locator : get file locations
locator --> hz : lookup shard owners
hz --> locator : orders on node1+2\nlineitem on node1+2+3

locator --> planner : plan()

planner --> hz : one node has all shards?
hz --> planner : node1 has orders + lineitem? YES

note right of planner
  ===== Plan =====
  All shards on node1
  → single endpoint
  → DuckDB JOIN path
  ================
end note

planner --> exec : execute(query, files)
exec --> duck : DUCKDB_JOIN

duck --> duck : CREATE VIEW orders_v\nAS SELECT * FROM\n  read_parquet([files])
duck --> duck : CREATE VIEW lineitem_v\nAS SELECT * FROM\n  read_parquet([files])

duck --> duck : SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM orders_v o\nJOIN lineitem_v l\nON o.o_orderkey = l.l_orderkey\nWHERE o.o_totalprice > 100000

note right of duck
  DuckDB execution:
  ┌─ read_parquet ──────┐
  │  filter (predicate) │
  ├─ hash join ─────────┤
  │  o_orderkey=l_orderkey│
  ├─ aggregate ─────────┤
  │  COUNT(*)           │
  └─ arrowExportStream ─┘
end note

duck --> exec : Arrow batch\n(count=12345)
exec --> client : VectorSchemaRoot

' === Alternative: distributed path ===
node2 --> node2 : (if shards NOT co-located)
node2 --> client : IOException →\nSpark does JOIN

@enduml
